      "Reverend Dr. Otis Moss, Jr., Class of 2011"
    ]
  },
  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "Reverend Dr. Otis Moss, Jr. Theologian, pastor and civic leader, the Reverend Dr. Otis Moss, Jr. is one of America’s most influential leaders. He was born in La Grange, GA. He earned his bachelor’s degree from Morehouse College, his master of divinity degree from Morehouse School of Religion/Inter-denominational Theological Center and his doctor of ministry degree from the United Theological Seminary. In 2008, Reverend Moss retired from Olivet Institutional Baptist Church located in Cleveland, Ohio following thirty-three years of distinguished service."
    ]
  },
